            "line": 387,
            "text": "def trans (P₀ : Path.Homotopic.Quotient x₀ x₁) (P₁ : Path.Homotopic.Quotient x₁ x₂) :\n    Path.Homotopic.Quotient x₀ x₂ :=\n  Quotient.map₂ Path.trans (fun (_ : Path x₀ x₁) _ hp (_ : Path x₁ x₂) _ hq => hcomp hp hq) P₀ P₁"
